<newsitem itemid="71116" id="root" date="1996-09-23" xml:lang="en">
<title>UK: TransTec lifts first half pretax 45 pct.</title>
<headline>TransTec lifts first half pretax 45 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year to June 30</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		3.1		    vs 2.3</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 0.8		    vs 0.7</p>
<p> Pretax		     4.5		    vs 3.1</p>
<p> Turnover		   114.0		  vs 106</p>
<p>NOTE - UK engineering group TransTec Plc said manufacturing and automotive volumes remained steady and the performance of the enlarged division, after an acquisition of BSK, should improve further over last year. When BSK is fully integrated, it will search for a further manufacturing acquisition.  </p>
<p> Operating profit	 5.53		   vs 4.12</p>
<p> Interest payable	 1.02		   vs 1.00</p>
<p> Tax charge		 1.34		   vs 0.87</p>
<p> Attributable	     3.17		   vs 2.23</p>
<p> Pay date		   Jan 13</p>
<p> Div registration date  Dec 10</p>
<p> Ex-div date		Dec 12</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 4017</p>
</text>
